{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CggypmbTAZum9Aa2U3TBu","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The 3D starter shell is clear. Now checking the 2D engine's built-ins the plan should reuse: audio and voices, attract mode, glyphs, saves, menus, dialogue, the rpg and grid modules."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":6434,"cache_read_input_tokens":164176,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":6434},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"041395ab-5146-4633-b27b-c7bc1bdf7a40","uuid":"d6ab5cc0-1107-431b-8a56-d2967c687365","timestamp":"2026-11-04T00:58:19.928Z","request_id":"req_011CggypmNKBZFBoJNZXPd3u"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CggypmbTAZum9Aa2U3TBu","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01BU1PgdmeHpXqkKhYdsVEwZ","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd $HOME/.cache/plan-x193f88-research/engine/repo/dist/handoff && grep -n -i \"voice\\|babble\\|speak\\|blip\\|gibber\\|animalese\" API.md API-INDEX.md AI_GUIDE.md | head -30","description":"Search engine docs for voice and babble support"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":6434,"cache_read_input_tokens":164176,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":6434},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"041395ab-5146-4633-b27b-c7bc1bdf7a40","uuid":"703344bc-0c7c-4c28-9947-3b6d4d64e4a2","timestamp":"2026-11-04T00:58:21.130Z","request_id":"req_011CggypmNKBZFBoJNZXPd3u","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_01BU1PgdmeHpXqkKhYdsVEwZ":{"command":"cd $HOME/.cache/plan-x193f88-research/engine/repo/dist/handoff && grep -n -i \"voice\\|babble\\|speak\\|blip\\|gibber\\|animalese\" API.md API-INDEX.md AI_GUIDE.md | head -30","description":"Search engine docs for voice and babble support"}}}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01BU1PgdmeHpXqkKhYdsVEwZ","type":"tool_result","content":"AI_GUIDE.md:308:- `Dialog` does typewriter text with blips, pages, speaker names and choices; `update` returns true while it is open, so the world waits. Its markup gives a word its color (`{c=#ffd36a}gold{/c}`), a beat before the next line (`{w=.5}`), a slow dread (`{s=12}...{/s}`), a scream that shakes (`{shake}`) or a song that bobs (`{wave}`), and the hero's name (`{$name}` from `vars`).\nAI_GUIDE.md:498:**Visual novel (Phoenix Wright, Snatcher, Clannad).** A painted backdrop per scene (`r.overlay`), the speaker's rig large (`rig.drawPortrait(g, x, y, 120, { zoom: 2 })`, its expression by `rig.update(dt, { expr: 'smile' })`), and the story module's nodes and choices for the script, its flags for the routes. `story.log` is the backlog (`{ who, name, text }`: draw the last lines when the player asks), `story.auto = 2` turns pages by themselves after two seconds, `story.skip = true` types and turns them at once (choices still wait). Save with `game.saves` (`story.state()` in its data).\nAI_GUIDE.md:558:- PaRappa's call and response: the teacher's notes are calls (`'c'`), sounded on their steps (`sfx(voice, { step })`) and drawn on a highway of their own (`rh.draw(r, { call: true })`); the player answers in the next bar.\nAPI-INDEX.md:1054:- `game.audio.define(name, voice)`: add or replace a named sound: audio.define('zap', { wave: 'saw', freq: 1200, to: 200, dur: .2 })\nAPI-INDEX.md:1063:- `game.audio.sfx(what, o = {})`: Play a sound effect: a preset name ('jump', 'coin', 'hit', 'explode', ...), a voice object, or a list of voices. opts: { vol: 0..1, pitch: multiplier, vary: random pitch spread (default 0.03), step: a step of the music playing (it sounds on that step of the music clock, scheduled with the music: a rhythm game's calls and claps) }\nAPI-INDEX.md:1074:- `game.audio.offset = 0` †: seconds the music sounds early, for speakers and headphones that lag (settings.audioOffset)\nAPI-INDEX.md:1075:- `game.audio.presets`: the named sound effects, sfx(name) plays one and define(name, voice) adds one\nAPI-INDEX.md:1106:- `new E.Dialog(game, o = {}) → talk`: new E.Dialog(game, { speed, lines, place, color, nameColor, voice, bg, border, vars }): a dialog box that types its text; say() opens it, update(dt) and draw(r) run it\nAPI-INDEX.md:1123:- `talk.name`: the speaker's name shown on the box\nAPI-INDEX.md:1124:- `talk.nameColor = '#ffd36a'`: the speaker's name's color\nAPI-INDEX.md:1134:- `talk.voice = 'text'`: the sound effect each letter blips ('text'; null for silence)\nAPI-INDEX.md:1267:- `click.say(lines, who)` †: the hero says lines (over his head; a line's time by its length); who: anything with x, y and k to speak instead\nAPI-INDEX.md:1543:- `new E.Rhythm(game, o = {}) → rhythm` †: new E.Rhythm(game, { song, chart, lanes, windows, life, lead, voice, on }): see the manual\nAPI-INDEX.md:1570:- `rhythm.voice` †: the calls' sound\nAPI-INDEX.md:1668:- `story.people`: who speaks, by id ({ name, portrait, at })\nAPI-INDEX.md:1672:- `story.talk`: the E.Dialog it speaks through\nAPI.md:160:- Dialog: `const talk = new E.Dialog(game)`; `talk.say(['Line one.', 'Page two.'], { name: 'ELDER', portrait: elderRig, onDone, choices: ['YES', 'NO'], onChoice(i) })` (choices show on the last page: the keys, or a tap or click on one, pick); in update `if (talk.update(dt)) return;` (true while a modal box is open: play waits); in draw `talk.draw(r)`. `portrait` takes a Humanoid (live close-up; `portraitSize: 40`, `portraitOpts: { zoom, turn }`) or a function `(g, x, y, size) => {...}`. Radio chatter during play: `talk.say('Enemy fighters ahead!', { name, portrait, auto: 2.5, modal: false })` turns its pages and closes by itself while the game keeps running. Per line: `place: 'top' | 'middle' | 'bottom'`, `y` (pixels) and `alpha` (see-through box). A portrait's mouth moves while its text types. `new E.Dialog(game, { speed, lines, color, nameColor, voice, bg, border, vars })`; `talk.close()`, `talk.open`. Markup in the text: `{c=#ffd36a}gold{/c}` a color, `{w=.5}` a pause, `{s=12}slowly{/s}` letters a second, `{shake}..{/shake}`, `{wave}..{/wave}`, `{$name}` a value from `say(text, { vars })` or `talk.vars`; text without markup is as it was.\nAPI.md:165:- `sfx(name, { vol, pitch })`. Presets: `jump jump2 land step coin pickup key powerup oneup heal hit hurt stomp bump swing whoosh punch kick shoot laser charge explode boom door secret warp die select confirm cancel pause text blip`.\nAPI.md:166:- Custom: `sfx({ wave: 'square' | 'pulse' | 'pulse12' | 'triangle' | 'saw' | 'sine' | 'noise', freq: 440 or 'A4', to: 880, dur: .2, vol: .3, arp: [0, 4, 7], step: .05, vib: [8, .03] })`, or `audio.define('zap', voice)`.\nAPI.md:168:- The music clock (the full engine): a song's place is game time, headless too, and the sound follows it. `music(song, { sync: true })` pauses with the game (else it plays on); `audio.pos` → `{ t, step, beat, bar, at, loop, bpm, layers, playing }`; `at(step, fn)`, `onBeat(fn)` (on the update step); `tempo(bpm)`; `layer(name or index, vol, fade)` (a track's `name`, `on: false` starts it silent: the chase's drums in by layers); `music(song, { fade: 1 })` crossfades; `sting(song, { at: 'bar' })` over the music; `sfx(voice, { step })` on a step of the music. `settings.audioOffset` (ms, Settings, Sound: Calibrate) sets `audio.offset`; `audio.calibrate()` → `{ tap(), result, done, stop() }`.\nAPI.md:275:  - `story`: dialogue as data (`E.Story`): nodes of lines with speakers and portraits, choices with conditions, flags and values (`{$name}` in lines), gotos, the game's events (one may hold the talk), a quest log, emote balloons over heads, a backlog, auto and skip; its state for a save. RPG, POINT-AND-CLICK, TACTICS.\nShell cwd was reset to /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-max.plan__20261103-174737__x193f88/work","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_u