{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cggyvk4bpAW74RPU4QNSh","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01SLvaNcyZZ3p4Pz22swqXT1","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd $HOME/.cache/plan-x193f88-research/engine/repo/dist/handoff && grep -n \"new E.Humanoid\\|new E.Blob\\|build:\\|'skeleton'\\|hunch\" API-INDEX.md | head -12; grep -n \"^## Characters\\|^- Characters\\|Humanoid({\" API.md | head","description":"Find Humanoid and Blob option docs"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1251,"cache_read_input_tokens":196976,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1251},"output_tokens":5,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"041395ab-5146-4633-b27b-c7bc1bdf7a40","uuid":"ee227eaf-560f-4e94-b18d-f1f61c1515e1","timestamp":"2026-11-04T01:00:09.857Z","request_id":"req_011CggyvjrSQVWy5EYJeJWur","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_01SLvaNcyZZ3p4Pz22swqXT1":{"command":"cd $HOME/.cache/plan-x193f88-research/engine/repo/dist/handoff && grep -n \"new E.Humanoid\\|new E.Blob\\|build:\\|'skeleton'\\|hunch\" API-INDEX.md | head -12; grep -n \"^## Characters\\|^- Characters\\|Humanoid({\" API.md | head","description":"Find Humanoid and Blob option docs"}}}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01SLvaNcyZZ3p4Pz22swqXT1","type":"tool_result","content":"112:- `E.build: \"dev-build\"`: the commit this copy was built from, a placeholder in the repo that tools/stamp.mjs replaces when the site deploys (e.g. 'a1b2c3d 2026-10-07')\n666:- `new E.Humanoid(o = {}) → rig`: new E.Humanoid({ size: 1.3, build, weapon, outfit, hair, hat, sleeves, armor, hood, cape, colors, ... }): a character rig posed from math every step (API.md, \"Characters\", lists the options); update(dt, state) each step, draw(g, ox, oy, view) inside r.actor. hat: 'cap' | 'band' | 'crown' | 'helmet' | 'pointed' (or { style, color }); hood: true (drawn in colors.hair)\n713:- `new E.Blob(o = {}) → blob`: new E.Blob({ R: 6.5, colors, ears, horns, wings, feet, tail, mouth, face }): a squash-and-stretch rig for slimes and jellies; blob.update(dt, state) each step, blob.draw(g, ox, oy, view) in an r.actor\n1689:- `strategy.ai(side, plan)` †: run side by plan ({ build: [[kind, n]], waves: { first, every, min }, script }): see the manual\n22:const rig = new E.Humanoid({ hat: 'pointed' });\n42:1. **Resolution** `res: 'ps1'` (320x240) or `'snes'`, with `expand: true` so it fills any screen (anchor the HUD to `r.W` / `r.H`), and characters 40-60 px tall: `new E.Humanoid({ size: 1.3 })` (HD style is the default: shaded volumetric limbs, outfits, hair).\n200:## Characters\n201:**Humanoid** (knights, heroes, soldiers, zombies): `new E.Humanoid({ size: 1.3, build: 'chibi' (default) | 'heroic' (tall, SotN) | 'bulky' (brawlers, bosses) | 'skeleton' (rib cage, skull, glowing eye sockets; tint with colors.bone), weapon: 'sword' (the default) | 'gun' | 'staff' | null (fists), outfit: 'shirt' | 'tunic' | 'robe' | 'coat', hair: 'short' | 'spiky' | 'long' | 'ponytail' | 'bald', hat: 'cap' | 'pointed' | 'helmet' | 'band' | 'crown' (or { style, color }), sleeves: 'short' | 'long' | 'none', armor, hood (in colors.hair), cape: { len: 6, width: 5, seg: 2.5 }, eyeGlow, hunch, lean, style: 'hd' (default) | 'classic' (stick figures for huge crowds), colors: { skin, hair, cloth, coat, pants, boot, belt, trim, glove, cape, capeIn, metal, plate, hilt, eye, iris } })` (`metal` colors the weapon, `plate` the armor, defaulting to `metal`).\nShell cwd was reset to /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-max.plan__20261103-174737__x193f88/work","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"041395ab-5146-4633-b27b-c7bc1bdf7a40","uuid":"36e0b6f9-09c8-44c2-9a95-cf789b9b502f","timestamp":"2026-11-04T01:00:10.221Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"112:- `E.build: \"dev-build\"`: the commit this copy was built from, a placeholder in the repo that tools/stamp.mjs replaces when the site deploys (e.g. 'a1b2c3d 2026-10-07')\n666:- `new E.Humanoid(o = {}) → rig`: new E.Humanoid({ size: 1.3, build, weapon, outfit, hair, hat, sleeves, armor, hood, cape, colors, ... }): a character rig posed from math every step (API.md, \"Characters\", lists the options); update(dt, state) each step, draw(g, ox, oy, view) inside r.actor. hat: 'cap' | 'band' | 'crown' | 'helmet' | 'pointed' (or { style, color }); hood: true (drawn in colors.hair)\n713:- `new E.Blob(o = {}) → blob`: new E.Blob({ R: 6.5, colors, ears, horns, wings, feet, tail, mouth, face }): a squash-and-stretch rig for slimes and jellies; blob.update(dt, state) each step, blob.draw(g, ox, oy, view) in an r.actor\n1689:- `strategy.ai(side, plan)` †: run side by plan ({ build: [[kind, n]], waves: { first, every, min }, script }): see the manual\n22:const rig = new E.Humanoid({ hat: 'pointed' });\n42:1. **Resolution** `res: 'ps1'` (320x240) or `'snes'`, with `expand: true` so it fills any screen (anchor the HUD to `r.W` / `r.H`), and characters 40-60 px tall: `new E.Humanoid({ size: 1.3 })` (HD style is the default: shaded volumetric limbs, outfits, hair).\n200:## Characters\n201:**Humanoid** (knights, heroes, soldiers, zombies): `new E.Humanoid({ size: 1.3, build: 'chibi' (default) | 'heroic' (tall, SotN) | 'bulky' (brawlers, bosses) | 'skeleton' (rib cage, skull, glowing eye sockets; tint with colors.bone), weapon: 'sword' (the default) | 'gun' | 'staff' | null (fists), outfit: 'shirt' | 'tunic' | 'robe' | 'coat', hair: 'short' | 'spiky' | 'long' | 'ponytail' | 'bald', hat: 'cap' | 'pointed' | 'helmet' | 'band' | 'crown' (or { style, color }), sleeves: 'short' | 'long' | 'none', armor, hood (in colors.hair), cape: { len: 6, width: 5, seg: 2.5 }, eyeGlow, hunch, lean, style: 'hd' (default) | 'classic' (stick figures for huge crowds), colors: { skin, hair, cloth, coat, pants, boot, belt, trim, glove, cape, capeIn, metal, plate, hilt, eye, iris } })` (`metal` colors the weapon, `plate` the armor, defaulting to `metal`).","stderr":"\nShell cwd was reset to /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-max.plan__20261103-174737__x193f88/work","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false,"bashEditDiff":{"files":[{"filePath":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-max.plan__20261103-174755__x531263/agent.out","hunks":[{"oldStart":495,"oldLines":3,"newStart":495,"newLines":4,"lines":[" {\"type\":\"system\",\"subtype\":\"thinking_tokens\",\"estimated_tokens\":2550,\"estimated_tokens_delta\":100,\"session_id\":\"f93111a9-5060-4eb2-b5bf-6a1585c61e13\",\"uuid\":\"952008de-4fd0-46e7-bf72-4e2c787682e1\"}"," {\"type\":\"system\",\"subtype\":\"thinking_tokens\",\"estimated_tokens\":2700,\"estimated_tokens_delta\":150,\"session_id\":\"f93111a9-5060-4eb2-b5bf-6a1585c61e13\",\"uuid\":\"ab2d959b-de90-4b4e-b171-4a9f781e2a58\"}"," {\"type\":\"system\",\"subtype\":\"thinking_tokens\",\"estimated_tokens\":2750,\"estimated_tokens_delta\":50,\"session_id\":\"f93111a9-5060-4eb2-b5bf-6a1585c61e13\",\"uuid\":\"f5733d55-b392-4011-b67b-9bbd4ad57826\"}","+{\"type\":\"system\",\"subtype\":\"thinking_tokens\",\"estimated_tokens\":2850,\"estimated_tokens_delta\":100,\"session_id\":\"f93111a9-5060-4eb2-b5bf-6a1585c61e13\",\"uuid\":\"d769fd26-cab