{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01QtHETXAqZZfcfVUpbbYPSP","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"Eye of the Beholder 1991 Westwood Associates SSI release party four characters two NPCs Waterdeep sewers Xanathar\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"Eye of the Beholder\",\"url\":\"https://giantbomb.com/wiki/Games/Eye_of_the_Beholder\"},{\"title\":\"Eye of the Beholder\",\"url\":\"https://www.giantbomb.com/games/3030-11234/\"},{\"title\":\"Eye of the Beholder 1991 76 85%\",\"url\":\"https://www.oldgames.sk/en/game/eye-of-the-beholder/download/4494\"},{\"title\":\"Eye of the Beholder 1991 76 85%\",\"url\":\"https://www.oldgames.sk/en/game/eye-of-the-beholder\"},{\"title\":\"Eye of the Beholder 1991 76\",\"url\":\"https://www.oldgames.sk/en/game/eye-of-the-beholder/download/266\"},{\"title\":\"Eye of the Beholder 1991 76 85%\",\"url\":\"https://www.oldgames.sk/en/game/eye-of-the-beholder/download/4018\"},{\"title\":\"Eye of the Beholder 1991 76\",\"url\":\"https://www.oldgames.sk/en/game/eye-of-the-beholder/covers\"},{\"title\":\"Eye of the Beholder 1991 76\",\"url\":\"https://www.oldgames.sk/en/game/eye-of-the-beholder/ratings\"},{\"title\":\"Eye of the Beholder 1991 76\",\"url\":\"https://www.oldgames.sk/en/game/eye-of-the-beholder/downloads\"},{\"title\":\"Eye of the Beholder 1991 76\",\"url\":\"https://www.oldgames.sk/en/game/eye-of-the-beholder/download/3972\"},{\"title\":\"Eye of the Beholder 1991 76\",\"url\":\"https://www.oldgames.sk/en/game/eye-of-the-beholder/download/4364\"},{\"title\":\"Eye of the Beholder 1991 76\",\"url\":\"https://www.oldgames.sk/en/game/eye-of-the-beholder/download/1560\"},{\"title\":\"Eye of the Beholder 1991 76\",\"url\":\"https://www.oldgames.sk/en/game/eye-of-the-beholder/projects\"},{\"title\":\"Eye of the Beholder\",\"url\":\"https://www.mobygames.com/game/835/eye-of-the-beholder/trivia/\"},{\"title\":\"Eye of the Beholder 1991 76 85%\",\"url\":\"https://www.oldgames.sk/en/game/eye-of-the-beholder/download/924\"},{\"title\":\"Eye of the Beholder\",\"url\":\"https://www.mobygames.com/game/835/\"},{\"title\":\"Eye of the Beholder 1991 76 85%\",\"url\":\"https://www.oldgames.sk/en/game/eye-of-the-beholder/download/3795\"},{\"title\":\"Eye of the Beholder\",\"url\":\"https://dazeland.com/en/Amiga/Eye_of_the_Beholder.html\"}]\n\nThe search supports all the details in your query. Eye of the Beholder was developed by Westwood Associates and published by Strategic Simulations, Inc. in 1991, first on PC DOS, almost simultaneously on Amiga. I didn't find anything specific about a release party, so that part is unconfirmed.\n\n- **Party size:** The starting party has four characters, and up to two NPCs can join later. A second source says the same, noting that in addition to the four base heroes, you can recruit two non-player characters along the way.\n- **Sewers and Xanathar:** The story begins when the Lords of the City of Waterdeep have put out a call for heroes to investigate the evil lurking in the sewers beneath their streets. The villain is a beholder known as Xanathar: a ruthless criminal hiding deep beneath the port city of Waterdeep. One source spells the name \"Xanatar,\" and another says that as soon as the adventurers enter the sewers their exit collapses — sealed by Xanathar.\n- **Developer:** Westwood Associates later became Westwood Studios, per the same developers that would go on to become Westwood Studios.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"041395ab-5146-4633-b27b-c7bc1bdf7a40","uuid":"ab7963df-3200-4071-b822-2ad76329d59b","timestamp":"2026-11-04T01:17:51.555Z","tool_use_result":{"query":"Eye of the Beholder 1991 Westwood Associates SSI release party four characters two NPCs Waterdeep sewers Xanathar","results":[{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_0155dxx3S3uGuivvrCsMEHV3","content":[{"title":"Eye of the Beholder","url":"https://giantbomb.com/wiki/Games/Eye_of_the_Beholder"},{"title":"Eye of the Beholder","url":"https://www.giantbomb.com/games/3030-11234/"},{"title":"Eye of the Beholder 1991 76 85%","url":"https://www.oldgames.sk/en/game/eye-of-the-beholder/download/4494"},{"title":"Eye of the Beholder 1991 76 85%","url":"https://www.oldgames.sk/en/game/eye-of-the-beholder"},{"title":"Eye of the Beholder 1991 76","url":"https://www.oldgames.sk/en/game/eye-of-the-beholder/download/266"},{"title":"Eye of the Beholder 1991 76 85%","url":"https://www.oldgames.sk/en/game/eye-of-the-beholder/download/4018"},{"title":"Eye of the Beholder 1991 76","url":"https://www.oldgames.sk/en/game/eye-of-the-beholder/covers"},{"title":"Eye of the Beholder 1991 76","url":"https://www.oldgames.sk/en/game/eye-of-the-beholder/ratings"},{"title":"Eye of the Beholder 1991 76","url":"https://www.oldgames.sk/en/game/eye-of-the-beholder/downloads"},{"title":"Eye of the Beholder 1991 76","url":"https://www.oldgames.sk/en/game/eye-of-the-beholder/download/3972"},{"title":"Eye of the Beholder 1991 76","url":"https://www.oldgames.sk/en/game/eye-of-the-beholder/download/4364"},{"title":"Eye of the Beholder 1991 76","url":"https://www.oldgames.sk/en/game/eye-of-the-beholder/download/1560"},{"title":"Eye of the Beholder 1991 76","url":"https://www.oldgames.sk/en/game/eye-of-the-beholder/projects"},{"title":"Eye of the Beholder","url":"https://www.mobygames.com/game/835/eye-of-the-beholder/trivia/"},{"title":"Eye of the Beholder 1991 76 85%","url":"https://www.oldgames.sk/en/game/eye-of-the-beholder/download/924"},{"title":"Eye of the Beholder","url":"https://www.mobygames.com/game/835/"},{"title":"Eye of the Beholder 1991 76 85%","url":"https://www.oldgames.sk/en/game/eye-of-the-beholder/download/3795"},{"title":"Eye of the Beholder","url":"https://dazeland.com/en/Amiga/Eye_of_the_Beholder.html"}]},"The search supports all the details in your query. Eye of the Beholder was developed by Westwood Associates and published by Strategic Simulations, Inc. in 1991, first on PC DOS, almost simultaneously on Amiga. I didn't find anything specific about a release party, so that part is unconfirmed.\n\n- **Party size:** The starting party has four characters, and up to two NPCs can join later. A second source says the same, noting that in addition to the four base heroes, you can recruit two non-player characters along the way.\n- **Sewers and Xanathar:** The story begins when the Lords of the City of Waterdeep have put out a call for heroes to investigate the evil lurking in the sewers beneath their streets. The villain is a beholder known as Xanathar: a ruthless criminal hiding deep beneath the port city of Waterdeep. One source spells the name \"Xanatar,\" and another says that as soon as the adventurers enter the sewers their exit collapses — sealed by Xanathar.\n- **Developer:** Westwood Associates later became Westwood Studios, per the same developers that would go on to become Westwood Studios."],"durationSeconds":4.582588400000008,"searchCount":1},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01QtHETXAqZZfcfVUpbbYPSP","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
