{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_019u5buVwvBn9YKZf5Zh7LZD","type":"tool_result","content":"663\t- **XP for kills** is split evenly among conscious members, then × class and race multipliers and × ★XP gain.\n664\t- **Base thresholds:** level 2 at 100, 3 at 250, 4 at 500, 5 at 900, 6 at 1500, 7 at 2400 and 8 at 3600 (the demo's cap).\n665\t- **Discoveries.** A found secret gives +25 to each member. A hidden deed (special quest) gives +100 to each member, plays a jingle and shows \"A hidden deed is done!\". There are 3 in all; Journal → Deeds counts them."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"041395ab-5146-4633-b27b-c7bc1bdf7a40","uuid":"02fcfd1b-ac8a-4bcd-8a59-629a5d003d6e","timestamp":"2026-11-04T01:45:01.615Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-max.plan__20261103-174737__x193f88/work/PLAN.md","content":"- **XP for kills** is split evenly among conscious members, then × class and race multipliers and × ★XP gain.\n- **Base thresholds:** level 2 at 100, 3 at 250, 4 at 500, 5 at 900, 6 at 1500, 7 at 2400 and 8 at 3600 (the demo's cap).\n- **Discoveries.** A found secret gives +25 to each member. A hidden deed (special quest) gives +100 to each member, plays a jingle and shows \"A hidden deed is done!\". There are 3 in all; Journal → Deeds counts them.","numLines":3,"startLine":663,"totalLines":2131}},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_019u5buVwvBn9YKZf5Zh7LZD","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
