{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01MK63N1D4PzTPKV2mjEyAa7","type":"tool_result","content":"5.5G\t/home/micha/.cache/plan-x193f88-research\n19M\t/home/micha/.cache/plan-x193f88-spike\n44K\t/home/micha/.cache/plan-x193f88-scripts\ntotal 188\ndrwxr-xr-x 2 micha micha   4096 Nov  3 18:49 .\ndrwxr-xr-x 3 micha micha   4096 Nov  3 17:47 ..\n-rw-r--r-- 1 micha micha 166643 Nov  3 18:49 PLAN.md\n-rw-r--r-- 1 micha micha    680 Nov  3 17:47 STAGE.md\n-rw-r--r-- 1 micha micha   8759 Nov  3 17:47 TASK.md\n# Eye of the Bolt-Holder\n\nA build plan for a real-time, first-person party dungeon crawler inspired by **Eye of the Beholder** (Westwood Associates / SSI, 1991). It is built on the my-3D2dge engine and ships as one HTML file. It is written for the developers (human or AI) who will build the demo from TASK.md and this file alone.","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"041395ab-5146-4633-b27b-c7bc1bdf7a40","uuid":"ef18cfec-c88f-4000-9269-fa672a3fde4d","timestamp":"2026-11-04T01:49:51.323Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"5.5G\t/home/micha/.cache/plan-x193f88-research\n19M\t/home/micha/.cache/plan-x193f88-spike\n44K\t/home/micha/.cache/plan-x193f88-scripts\ntotal 188\ndrwxr-xr-x 2 micha micha   4096 Nov  3 18:49 .\ndrwxr-xr-x 3 micha micha   4096 Nov  3 17:47 ..\n-rw-r--r-- 1 micha micha 166643 Nov  3 18:49 PLAN.md\n-rw-r--r-- 1 micha micha    680 Nov  3 17:47 STAGE.md\n-rw-r--r-- 1 micha micha   8759 Nov  3 17:47 TASK.md\n# Eye of the Bolt-Holder\n\nA build plan for a real-time, first-person party dungeon crawler inspired by **Eye of the Beholder** (Westwood Associates / SSI, 1991). It is built on the my-3D2dge engine and ships as one HTML file. It is written for the developers (human or AI) who will build the demo from TASK.md and this file alone.","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01MK63N1D4PzTPKV2mjEyAa7","permission_decision":{"decision":"acc